From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 17:57:48 +0200
Subject: media: cedrus: h616: enable VC-1 decoding

The H616 video engine decodes VC-1. Tested with the SMPTE conformance
bitstreams which are publicly available, generated Simple, Main and
Advanced profile streams compared with the SMPTE reference decoder and
real-world WMV3/WVC1 files.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus.c
@@ -864,7 +864,8 @@ static const struct cedrus_variant sun50i_h616_cedrus_variant = {
 			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_H265_DEC |
 			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_H265_10_DEC |
 			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_VP8_DEC |
-			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_VP9_DEC,
+			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_VP9_DEC |
+			  CEDRUS_CAPABILITY_VC1_DEC,
 	.mod_rate	= 600000000,
 	/*
 	 * With the 128-bit DDR mode, H.264 and VP8 read corrupted reference
-- 
Armbian

